# The pipeline's working directory (top level only). Anchored so that a
# results tree's own judge/runs/ output is NOT ignored: the unanchored form
# kept stage C's per-completion judge labels off the results branch.
/runs/
# Fetched Kaggle kernel output. Bulky (~150MB/sweep, almost all of it LoRA
# adapter weights, which are regenerable from the config and seed). Curated
# artifacts from a run belong in results/ instead.
kaggle_output*/

# Quarantine boundary. Vendor-attribution material for the second paper is
# written here and NEVER committed to this repository -- see the release test.
# It is gitignored from the first commit, before any data exists, because a
# boundary added after the fact is a boundary that has already been crossed.
private_runs/**
!private_runs/.gitkeep

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/
